      "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Security policy</h1><a id=\"user-content-security-policy\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Security policy\" href=\"#security-policy\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If you believe you’ve found a security issue, please <strong>do not</strong> open a public issue.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Instead, open a GitHub Security Advisory (preferred) or contact the maintainers privately with:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>A short description of the issue and impact</li>\n<li>Reproduction steps (minimal)</li>\n<li>Any relevant logs or screenshots</li>\n</ul>\n</article>",
